21837257,2026-05-03,Mortgage,FHA mortgage,Struggling to pay mortgage,"An existing modification, forbearance plan, short sale, or other loss mitigation relief","CFPB Complaint ( Escalation / Servicing Error Framing ) Company : Rocket Mortgage , LLC Loan Number : XXXX I am filing a formal complaint regarding mortgage servicing errors, failure to provide accurate reinstatement information, and inconsistent loan status reporting following the end of my forbearance period. 

This complaint involves a servicing breakdown under federal mortgage servicing standards, including inaccurate or inconsistent payoff/reinstatement information and failure to properly apply or reconcile payments. 

Issue Summary After exiting forbearance, I was not provided a formal reinstatement quote or binding payoff calculation. Instead, I received a mortgage statement showing a total amount due of {$7000.00}. I paid this exact amount in full based on the written statement provided by Rocket Mortgage. 
