Given the urgency of my situation, I am asking for your assistance and compassion in expediting this process. I should not have to continue calling daily for a letter I have already been requesting for two weeks. This delay is directly impacting my ability to secure a job, and I need this matter resolved immediately.

I kindly request that the settlement letter be issued and sent to me as soon as possible.

Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter. 
