22658961,2026-05-28,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Problem with a purchase shown on your statement,Credit card company isn't resolving a dispute about a purchase on your statement,"As a long-time Wells Fargo credit card customer, I unexpectedly found myself facing serious financial complications over the past three months. 
